          %h2#references References
          %p
            We list references that use the “non-geometric”-terminology. But notice that all
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+2d+CFT"} rational 2d CFT
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gepner+model"} Gepner model
            compactifications discussed in the 1990s are “non-geometric”, but the term wasn’t around then. Hence see the references at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gepner+model"} Gepner model
            for more.
          %h3#general_2 General
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Alex Flournoy, Brian Wecht, Brook Williams,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Constructing Nongeometric Vacua in String Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0404217"} arXiv:hep-th/0404217
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Katrin+Becker"}> Katrin Becker
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Melanie+Becker"} Melanie Becker
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Johannes+Walcher"} Johannes Walcher
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Moduli Stabilization in Non-Geometric Backgrounds
                %strong 770
                (2007) 1-46 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0611001"}> arXiv:hep-th/0611001
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                Erik Plauschinn,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Non-geometric backgrounds in string theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.11203"} arXiv:1811.11203
            %li
              %p
                Dan Israel,
                %em Mirrored K3 automorphisms and non-geometric compactifications
                2018 (
                %a{:href => "http://www2.yukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~nfst2018/Slide/Israel.pdf"}> pdf
                )
          %h3#heterotic_string Heterotic string
          %p
            Non-geometric
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string"} heterotic string
            vacua
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jock+McOrist"}> Jock McOrist
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Morrison"} David Morrison
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Savdeep+Sethi"} Savdeep Sethi
                %em Geometries, Non-Geometries, and Fluxes
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1004.5447"}> arXiv:1004.5447
                )
            %li
              %p
                Anamaría Font, Christoph Mayrhofer,
                %em
                  Non-Geometric Vacua of the
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi SO
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mn 32
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mo .
                        %msub
                          %mi ℤ
                          %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SO(32).\mathbb{Z}_2
                  Heterotic String and Little String Theories
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1708.05428"}> arXiv:1708.05428
                )
            %li
              %p
                Anamaría Font, Iñaki García-Etxebarria,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dieter+L%C3%BCst"} Dieter Lüst
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Heterotic T-fects, 6D SCFTs, and F-Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.09361"} arXiv:1603.09361
            %li
              %p
                Iñaki García-Etxebarria,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dieter+L%C3%BCst"} Dieter Lüst
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Ubiquity of non-geometry in heterotic compactifications
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.10291"} arXiv:1611.10291
          %h3#flux_compactifications Flux compactifications
          %p
            Non-geometric
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux+compactification"} flux compactification
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Anamaria Font, Adolfo Guarino, Jesus M. Moreno,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebras and non-geometric flux vacua
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0809.3748"} arXiv:0809.3748
            %li
              %p
                David Andriot, Andre Betz,
                %em Supersymmetry with non-geometric fluxes, or a β-twist in Generalized Geometry and Dirac operator
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.6640"}> arXiv:1411.6640
                )
